{
  "name": "Mental Health Inventory (MHI-38)",
  "slug": "mhi-38",
  "description": "A 38-item self-report of mental-health status over the past month, scored on six subscales: anxiety, depression, loss of behavioural/emotional control, general positive affect, emotional ties, and life satisfaction. Items 2, 22 and 38 are administered but not counted toward any subscale (per the published MHI-38 scoring key).",
